00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.760
<b>That man...</b>

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.930
<b>Are you all right, Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.480
<b>I think it might hurt a little...</b>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.360
<b>Eh!</b>

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.900
<b>No, that spot is worse.</b>

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.530
<b>Try your best. It's just a bit more.</b>

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.530
<b>Don't!</b>

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.000
<b>Here I go.</b>

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.920
<b>Just a bit more.</b>

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.130
<b>I can't hold it any longer.</b>

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.510
<b>And it was only a little more.</b>

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.050
<b>Really.</b>

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:25.930
<b>And Mayu was desperately trying to hold you up too.</b>

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:31.560
<b>Shungo, do you really want to help with the training or not?</b>

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.320
<b>Even though Mayu-chan is improving everyday...</b>

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.440
<b>Forgive me, Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.790
<b>It's okay. I'll try harder for the next one.</b>

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:47.250
<b>No matter how impossible the posture, I'll hold you up for sure.</b>

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.710
<b>Okay, one more time then.</b>

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.880
<b>Let's do our best!</b>

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.380
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.760
<b>Ojou-sama will surely have a lot to say about this.</b>

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.480
<b>Reika-chan, you've been making a lot of mistakes lately.</b>

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.650
<b>I must punish clumsy maids.</b>

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.990
<b>What a bad girl. You're so sensitive.</b>

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.490
<b>Not there!</b>

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:24.830
<b>I... really... no more!</b>

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.370
<b>Don't!</b>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.920
<b>Will you stop it?</b>

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.610
<b>Ojou-sama, aren't you going for that brand?</b>

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.450
<b>You're going to miss the chance to buy it.</b>

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.290
<b>If this continues, then there's no hope of stealing Ninomiya-kun from Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.750
<b>Even the Nee-san{sister} will get sick of you eventually.</b>

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.160
<b>Man.</b>

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.670
<b>Who is trying to steal Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.510
<b>As the student council president, I'm merely...</b>

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:28.770
<b>keeping an eye on that Tsukimura Mayu who has indecent male-female friendship practices.</b>

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:34.860
<b>For that purpose, I'll have to be patient with her extremely shameful training.</b>

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.810
<b>You're back to normal. That's good.</b>

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.240
<b>Or so I say.</b>

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:46.330
<b><i>Nothing will happen if I carry on like this.</i></b>

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.120
<b><i>Pathetic.</i></b>

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.820
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:01.630
<b><i>If only I didn't remember what happened back then.</i></b>

