<b>See, put in the salt now.</b>

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.190
<b>I know.</b>

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.360
<b><i>It's Again!</i></b>

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.030
<b>It's delicious.</b>

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.830
<b>Of course. It's easy too.</b>

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:11.610
<b><i>What in the world?!</i></b>

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.540
<b>Come on, hurry.</b>

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.170
<b>Hey, wait.</b>

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.300
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.050
<b>Hey, hey!</b>

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.930
<b>Wake up!</b>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.810
<b>I'm begging you.</b>

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.520
<b>Please open your eyes.</b>

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.400
<b><i>Who is she?</i></b>

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.690
<b>Who is she?!</b>

00:07:56.370 --> 00:08:01.290
<b>Houjou-senpai?! This is because I was having a strange dream.</b>

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.540
<b>It's fine.</b>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.400
<b>Well, what might this be?</b>

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.900
<b>You two are slacking off again.</b>

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.450
<b>Especially you, Shungo. You've been overly lazy.</b>

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.030
<b>As punishment you're going to do some training.</b>

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.500
<b>That sounds like fun.</b>

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:40.330
<b>It just so happens that I have some favours to collect from my old friends.</b>

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.130
<b>I think they'd make the perfect partners for you.</b>

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:44.870
<b>Come on...</b>

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:51.390
<b>We'll be back at night, so clean up the house, Reika-chan. Got it?</b>

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.930
<b>Sheesh, what's going on?!</b>

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:55.050
<b>Sheesh, what's going on?!</b>

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:55.180
<b>Sheesh, what's going on?!</b>

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:55.300
<b>Sheesh, what's going on?!</b>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.020
<b>Ojou-sama?</b>

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.900
<b><i>Hosaka, take care of the work I left there.</i></b>

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.520
<b>Again?</b>

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.440
<b>Please don't just do maid work.</b>

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.650
<b><i>It's not like I'm doing it because I like it!!</i></b>

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.450
<b>Really.</b>

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.540
<b>Oh, Reika-san.</b>

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.420
<b>Do you know where Ninomiya-kun is?</b>

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.040
<b>Nii-san and Ryoko-san seem to be gone too.</b>

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.720
<b>They went out to do training.</b>

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.680
<b>It seems like they'll be back at night.</b>

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.050
<b>Should I help out?</b>

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:39.760
<b>Eh?!</b>

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.100
<b>Ah, that expression on your face says you don't want me to help. {lit. I'm sure you made a "don't want" face just now}</b>

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.480
<b>Despite my appearance, I'm really good at cleaning.</b>

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.820
<b>How do I put it? My cleaning spirit is above having three meals daily.</b>

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.740
<b><i>She's definitely lying.</i></b>

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.780
<b>Let's get started right away.</b>

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:58.490
<b>No thanks! If you help, no cleaning will get done.</b>

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.580
<b>You didn't have to shout at me.</b>

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.210
<b>Tsukimura Mayu! You are...</b>

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:45.790
<b>Yes?</b>

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:51.420
<b>People are trying to clean here and you bring in dolls one after another.</b>

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.670
<b>I just wanted to bring more life into this bland room.</b>

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:00.720
<b>I'm doing the cleaning here. So would you please stop making my life difficult?</b>

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:12.820
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.270
<b>I didn't mean to.</b>

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.160
<b>Re- Reika-san...</b>

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.750
<b>Okay!</b>

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.310
<b>Allow me to introduce you.</b>

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.730
<b>This is the butcher, Yamada-san.</b>

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.940
<b>Butcher? Of what meat?</b>

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.570
<b>Okay, round one, fight!</b>

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.340
<b>Okay, next.</b>

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.210
<b>Reika-san.</b>

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.760
<b>Please, let me help with the cleaning too.</b>

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.260
<b>Like I said, you'll only make things harder if you help.</b>

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.020
<b>Next is the kitchen, right?</b>

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:30.690
<b>Hey, wait. I told you not to help, didn't I?</b>

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:36.860
<b>It'll be fine. When I'm wearing this,
I'm filled with the spirit of the maid!</b>

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.870
<b>This is the carpenter, Tanaka-san.</b>

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.460
<b>You wear that to cut trees, right?</b>

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.210
<b>Let's start round two. Fight!</b>

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.310
<b>Another life or death situation.</b>

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.610
<b>So, what did you do before I got here?</b>

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:20.610
<b>Well, right now, I'm filled with the spirit of the maid.</b>

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.070
<b>Look at the state of things!</b>

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:27.790
<b>The moment you turn on the faucet, the water gushes out.</b>

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.580
<b>This happened once before too.</b>

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:33.710
<b>It's just ridiculous that you could drop the plates when there was nothing there at all. {'nothing at all there' to 'nothing there at all'}</b>

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:37.460
<b>It was slippery and I slipped.</b>

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:42.840
<b>On top of that, after I thought I had everything
cleaned up, you line up those dolls one after another.</b>

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.510
<b>I thought it would be fun to change the atmosphere once in a while.</b>

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.310
<b>Tsukimura Mayu!</b>

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.600
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:56.400
<b>Anyway, just dry the floor. Now!</b>

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:57.980
<b>Okay.</b>

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.330
<b>Sheesh.</b>

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.050
<b>What is it this time?</b>

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.720
<b>Well, this.</b>

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.020
<b>It looks like a hidden room.</b>

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.900
<b>Why are there such mechanisms?</b>

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.100
<b>Hey, Reika-san. Let's go in and have a look.</b>

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:43.860
<b>Don't be stupid. Who'd be willing to enter such a blatantly suspicious place?</b>

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.870
<b>Tsukimura Mayu?</b>

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.880
<b>This is the journalist, Nakayama-san.</b>

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.720
<b>Soon, the genre will...</b>

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.600
<b>This is the last one. Fight!</b>

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.150
<b>This is just so wrong.</b>

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:26.110
<b>Those two always appear out of nowhere. So this mansion has this kinda secret.</b>

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:29.150
<b>But, this is like a maze, so it's fun.</b>

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.490
<b>This is no time to be having fun in a maze.</b>

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:36.750
<b>As long as this passage exists, they can observe us anywhere at anytime.</b>

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:40.870
<b>So that means they know about that book I'm hiding?</b>

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.710
<b>That book?</b>

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.840
<b>Huh! No, it's nothing.</b>

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:46.130
<b>More importantly, we have to find a way out quickly.</b>

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.930
<b>It's rare for you to think correctly and logically.</b>

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:53.640
<b>It's highly probable that there's an emergency exit out of here.</b>

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.180
<b>That's right.</b>

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:55.970
<b>Stop!</b>

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.020
<b>Look at these.</b>

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.320
<b>These sensors probably trigger some kind of trap.</b>

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:05.280
<b>Trap?</b>

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.160
<b>This feels like the work of that shameless woman.</b>

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:12.490
<b>From the arrangement of the sensors, we should be fine if we go along the wall.</b>

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>Please follow after me.</b>

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.880
<b>How?</b>

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.390
<b>Reika-san...</b>

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.390
<b>Why those...</b>

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.290
<b>As I said, those breasts are pointless!</b>

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.950
<b>You don't have to tell me!</b>

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:10.670
<b>I can't move anymore.</b>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.470
<b>We're totally lost because of that.</b>

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.100
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:20.640
<b>Being depressed won't help.</b>

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.560
<b>You'll be fine after a short rest.</b>

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.480
<b>Right.</b>

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.530
<b>Umm, Reika-san...</b>

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.530
<b>What is it?</b>

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.410
<b>There's a switch here.</b>

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.990
<b>Don't push it, stupid. Something bad might happen again.</b>

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:42.490
<b>Wha-? I already pressed it.</b>

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.010
<b>This is the storeroom, isn't it?</b>

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.520
<b>Why is it in a place like this?</b>

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.520
<b>I wonder if these belong to Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.520
<b>And are these Ryoko-san's?</b>

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.980
<b>I missed you...</b>

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.190
<b>so much.</b>

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.150
<b>It's Ninomiya-kun when he was still a kid.</b>

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:54.530
<b>Would you stop doing that?</b>

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:01.200
<b>A long time ago, there was a boy I liked.</b>

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.830
<b>Why are you saying this all of a sudden?</b>

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.630
<b>A long time ago, I was sick.</b>

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:12.170
<b>Because of that, I'm not able to remember much from my childhood.</b>

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.970
<b>I'm totally fine now.</b>

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:21.810
<b>But I don't remember what kinda person he was.</b>

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:25.600
<b>However, I do clearly remember that I liked him.</b>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:34.110
<b>Do you have someone like that, Reika-san?</b>

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.160
<b>I...</b>

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.170
<b>Even I...</b>

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.080
<b>This is!</b>

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:52.460
<b>Huh!</b>

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.460
<b><b>Don't Open</b></b>

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.460
<b><b>Don't Open</b></b>

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.460
<b>Hell Will Break Loose                        If Opened\h           \h</b>

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.050
<b>What an object.</b>

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.470
