00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:06.060
<b>D-Don't say it. I'm also a grown person in a way.</b>

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.850
<b>There's no way I'd open it.</b>

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.360
<b>Reika-san!</b>

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.160
<b>What have you done?</b>

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.250
<b>What in the world is that?</b>

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.770
