00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:49.970
<b>Why was it constructed to connect to a place like this?</b>

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.730
<b>We finally managed to get out.</b>

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.320
<b>Oh no. It's already evening.</b>

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.280
<b>I have to prepare dinner soon.</b>

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:02.070
